(7557943, 1210939, 100831, '<td valign="top">From Ode to the Onion by Pablo Neruda<br/>"You make us cry without hurting us.<br/>I have praised everything that exists,<br/>but to me, onion, you are<br/>more beautiful than a bird<br/>of dazzling feathers,<br/>heavenly globe, platinum goblet,<br/>unmoving dance<br/>of the snowy anemone<br/> <br/>and the fragrance of the earth lives<br/>in your crystalline nature."<br/> <br/>As to the photo, which I do enjoy, I''m wondering if you tried a closer crop to isolate the onion? I do like the heart at the center.</td>', 'From Ode to the Onion by Pablo Neruda"You make us cry without hurting us.I have praised everything that exists,but to me, onion, you aremore beautiful than a birdof dazzling feathers,heavenly globe, platinum goblet,unmoving danceof the snowy anemone and the fragrance of the earth livesin your crystalline nature." As to the photo, which I do enjoy, I''m wondering if you tried a closer crop to isolate the onion? I do like the heart at the center.', '2018-02-07 11:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
