(7558802, 1210939, 75651, '<td valign="top">Subject is in focus and very eye appealing (pun intended). The one drawback to this IMO is the composition.  the center composition with falloff out at the top right and bottom left corners really don''t do anything for the subject and add as a distraction instead of assisting in telling the story.  Suggestion would have been to fill the entire frame with your subject and let the swirls roll the eye all around the photo,  Very nice subject and thought though,</td>', 'Subject is in focus and very eye appealing (pun intended). The one drawback to this IMO is the composition.  the center composition with falloff out at the top right and bottom left corners really don''t do anything for the subject and add as a distraction instead of assisting in telling the story.  Suggestion would have been to fill the entire frame with your subject and let the swirls roll the eye all around the photo,  Very nice subject and thought though,', '2018-02-11 12:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7558803, 1211522, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject, color and lines.  Seem to tilt my head when viewing this - would almost wish you rotated 90 degrees clockwise and the flipped horizontally so my eyes naturally fall across the photo from left to right and top to bottom.  I like it though!</td>', 'Very nice subject, color and lines.  Seem to tilt my head when viewing this - would almost wish you rotated 90 degrees clockwise and the flipped horizontally so my eyes naturally fall across the photo from left to right and top to bottom.  I like it though!', '2018-02-11 12:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7558805, 1211403, 75651, '<td valign="top">This works very well.  the drops of light spots pull my eyes everywhere while the dark spot pulls me back in.  I''ll be surprised if this isnt in the top 5.</td>', 'This works very well.  the drops of light spots pull my eyes everywhere while the dark spot pulls me back in.  I''ll be surprised if this isnt in the top 5.', '2018-02-11 12:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
