(7559318, 1211403, 29486, '<td valign="top">Awesome. After 13+ years I finally cracked the Top 5. I was just about recovered from a week long sore throat and took a little walk to see what it was like to go outside again when I ran across this perfect dandelion. In the rare cases I''ve run across them they are always broken. So I went home, got my camera and took some shots with my macro lens. I then realized that the challenge was Macros! Well hot dang. And the rest as they say is history. Thanks for the votes!</td>', 'Awesome. After 13+ years I finally cracked the Top 5. I was just about recovered from a week long sore throat and took a little walk to see what it was like to go outside again when I ran across this perfect dandelion. In the rare cases I''ve run across them they are always broken. So I went home, got my camera and took some shots with my macro lens. I then realized that the challenge was Macros! Well hot dang. And the rest as they say is history. Thanks for the votes!', '2018-02-14 01:05:30.000000', NULL, 0),
