(7559373, 1211413, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that fulfils the challenge brief fully<br/> <br/>Well you had some of your commenters foxed Ellie, so you have achieved the challenge brief. Your composition with the hook in the prominent position it is for me reveals it as the subject matter. What else could I have done to sharpen this on a dull day? Well, you are close to maximum aperture, a smaller aperture would have given you a deeper DOF thus making more of your subject sharper, to compensate for the slower shutter speed you would have needed to increase the ISO and also reflecting some natural light back into the subject could have helped too.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that fulfils the challenge brief fully Well you had some of your commenters foxed Ellie, so you have achieved the challenge brief. Your composition with the hook in the prominent position it is for me reveals it as the subject matter. What else could I have done to sharpen this on a dull day? Well, you are close to maximum aperture, a smaller aperture would have given you a deeper DOF thus making more of your subject sharper, to compensate for the slower shutter speed you would have needed to increase the ISO and also reflecting some natural light back into the subject could have helped too.', '2018-02-14 09:59:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7559383, 1211526, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, very delicate looking.</td>', 'Beautiful image, very delicate looking.', '2018-02-14 13:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
